      "review_description": "Under any circumstances do not use or have anything to do with RVB, even if they are $500 cheaper. You will pay that and more in the end financially and emotionally. Just trying to get the job finished and connected to the grid. Mine is a long story, they will stop answering calls or messages and if they do answer, they make promises which they don't keep. My installation was was started in February 2023, finally finished in March but they did not send the Application to connect to the grid to my supplier till June after I contacted them. It was rejected 4 times because it was not correct. For 2 months, I have been trying to get them to arrange a truck appointment without luck. I have hired an independent Electrician and he arrange it in 1 day.The solar was paid for in full, in March, but I have had no solar credits for the last 8 months due to their incomitance.So BAD on so many levels.",
